u KMS, encrypt them with a shared or per-device key, and manage device keys in SymKMS.",{"_121":428},"platform/updates/signing-and-encryption.mdx",{"_97":430,"_104":140,"_117":-7,"_99":431},"en:_9","Guides",{"_97":433,"_104":114,"_99":59,"_108":434,"_117":-7,"_12":58,"_119":435},"en:platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out.mdx","Create an update pack, attach an artifact, build the deliverable and roll it out to a device group in batches.",{"_121":436},"platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out.mdx",{"_97":438,"_104":114,"_99":47,"_108":439,"_117":-7,"_12":46,"_119":440},"en:platform/updates/guides/connect-a-device.mdx","What a device must do to receive updates from Lamassu Updates, in native mode and in hawkBit mode.",{"_121":441},"platform/updates/guides/connect-a-device.mdx",{"_97":443,"_104":114,"_99":50,"_108":444,"_117":-7,"_12":49,"_119":445},"en:platform/updates/guides/dashboard.mdx","Publish, roll out and follow an update from the Lamassu dashboard, screen by screen.",{"_121":446},"platform/updates/guides/dashboard.mdx",{"_97":448,"_104":114,"_99":56,"_108":449,"_117":-7,"_12":55,"_119":450},"en:platform/updates/guides/native-curl.mdx","Every request of a complete update in native mode, from creating a pack to the last device, with real responses.",{"_121":451},"platform/updates/guides/native-curl.mdx",{"_97":453,"_104":114,"_99":53,"_108":454,"_117":-7,"_12":52,"_119":455},"en:platform/updates/guides/hawkbit-curl.mdx","Every request of a complete update in hawkBit mode, including the device side over DDI, with real responses.",{"_121":456},"platform/updates/guides/hawkbit-curl.mdx",{"_97":458,"_104":140,"_117":-7,"_99":459},"en:_10","Reference",{"_97":461,"_104":114,"_99":74,"_108":462,"_117":-7,"_12":73,"_119":463},"en:platform/updates/reference/api.mdx","Every route of the Lamassu Updates and SymKMS HTTP APIs, with request bodies, status codes and per-backend behaviour.",{"_121":464},"platform/updates/reference/api.mdx",{"_97":466,"_104":114,"_99":